---

# 9. Conclusion

This project developed a Machine Learning system for automatic support ticket classification and priority assignment.

The system:

* processes ticket text
* converts text into numerical features
* predicts ticket category and urgency

Logistic Regression gave the best performance for ticket classification.

The project demonstrates how NLP and Machine Learning can help automate customer support operations and save time for support teams.
